{"content":"Implemented the fix for repositories whose `.gitignore` contains `.*`.\n\n### Changes\n- Prevented ignore matching from excluding the traversal root (`\".\"`) in:\n  - `ListDirectory`, used by file completion.\n  - `FastGlobWalker`, used by fallback glob and grep traversal.\n- Descendant hidden files remain ignored as expected.\n- Added a regression test confirming:\n  - Visible root and nested files are returned.\n  - `.gitignore` and other dotfiles remain excluded.\n  - Both directory listing and glob traversal handle `.*` correctly.\n\n### Verification\n- Reviewed the final source against the traversal and ignore invariants.\n- Attempted `go test ./internal/fsext`, but it was cancelled by fail-fast when the parallel formatting check could not start because `gofmt` is unavailable in the environment. Therefore, automated tests could not be completed; this is the remaining verification limitation.","type":"text"}
